; TEST-ARGS: -single-vscale:2
; CHECK: <vscale:2 x 2 x i4>
; CHECK: Transformation seems to be correct!

; Same transformation as scalablevector3.opt, which runs it at vscale 1.
; The number of lanes follows vscale, so at vscale 2 this type has four lanes,
; lane 3 exists, and the transformation is correct.

Name: insert and extract at lane 3

%t = insertelement <vscale x 2 x i4> %vec, i4 %x, i64 0
%r = extractelement <vscale x 2 x i4> %t, i64 0
=>
%u = insertelement <vscale x 2 x i4> %vec, i4 %x, i64 3
%r = extractelement <vscale x 2 x i4> %u, i64 3
